Imperials from &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt; will detect the drone's energy signature. As long as it's present, they'll send attackers approximately every &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;8 hours&lt;/color&gt; to destroy it and steal the wealth they think it contains. You will have some time to prepare defenses around it before they arrive.

