					<description>A mechanoid cluster has landed not far from &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt;. There's &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;a psychic suppressor machine&lt;/color&gt; there tuned to the female gender and there's a mech cluster.

The mech cluster will remain until you send a team there to attack and destroy it.</description>
					<root>ProblemCauser</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags>
						<li>ProblemCauser</li>
					</tags>
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>78</id>
					<name>Ancient Complex Looting</name>
					<appearanceTick>11563000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>11563000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>11673393</cleanupTick>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>You've learned of an ancient complex nearby that is said to contain ancient treasure.

You can break in to collect the loot inside.

Be warned - these kinds of structures can contain a variety of threats. In addition, your activity at the complex might draw unwanted attention.</description>
					<root>OpportunitySite_AncientComplex</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>79</id>
					<name>Hidden Construction Examination</name>
					<appearanceTick>11666952</appearanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>-60000</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt;, Ethical Chair of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Erera&lt;/color&gt;, has discovered an ancient complex a long distance away. She believes it contains information about the relic known as &lt;color=#D9D9BFFF&gt;Axe of Promises&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt; can't spare people to look into it, but hopes you can help by supplying exactly 5 colonists to carry out the investigation.

The complex contains unknown threats and is also being sought by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt;'s enemies, &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Burning Unit&lt;/color&gt;.

She will send a shuttle to pick up your colonists, bring them to the complex, and take them home afterward. They will be fed and tended to en-route.

Once you have landed, you must hack all terminals in the complex within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;2.8 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
					<root>AncientComplex_Mission</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts>
						<li Class="QuestPart_PassAllActivable">
							<inSignalEnable>Quest79.Initiate</inSignalEnable>
							<outSignalsCompleted>
								<li>Quest79.AllTerminalsHacked</li>
							</outSignalsCompleted>
							<inSignals>
								<li>Quest79.terminal0.Hacked</li>
								<li>Quest79.terminal1.Hacked</li>
								<li>Quest79.terminal2.Hacked</li>
							</inSignals>
							<signalsReceived />
							<outSignalAny>Quest79.TerminalHacked</outSignalAny>
							<expiryInfoPartKey>TerminalsHacked</expiryInfoPartKey>
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_Message">
