						<name>Dark Temple</name>
						<adjective>nudist</adjective>
						<memberName>Nudist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In an old universe of strife, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tro'catro&lt;/color&gt; whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tro'catro&lt;/color&gt; created light so that humanity could know &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tro'catro&lt;/color&gt; through the shadows light creates. The people wore clothes, and looking up at &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tro'catro&lt;/color&gt; asked, "Why aren't you clothed? It is disgusting." And the Spirit of Skin replied, "Your form and mine were created from the heavens. To cover them is what is truly disgusting."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In an old universe of strife, %%deity0_name%% whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. %%Deity0_name%% created light so that humanity could know %%deity0_name%% through the shadows light creates. The people wore clothes, and looking up at %%deity0_name%% asked, "Why aren't you clothed? It is disgusting." And the %%deity0_type%% replied, "Your form and mine were created from the heavens. To cover them is what is truly disgusting."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
